# CodeRabbit

> AI-driven code now outpaces human capacity. We help teams ship code, not surprises.

This index is generated from CodeRabbit's Git-owned English website content. Verify setup and product behavior against the linked page and official documentation.

## Product

- [The future isn't writing code. It's understanding it.](https://www.coderabbit.ai): AI-driven code now outpaces human capacity. We help teams ship code, not surprises.
- [One agent for your entire Software Development Lifecycle. Right in Slack.](https://www.coderabbit.ai/agent): Bring the agentic SDLC into Slack with CodeRabbit, where teams can plan work, answer repo questions, and keep development moving.
- [Vibe check your Code, now in CLI](https://www.coderabbit.ai/cli): Smart CLI Reviews act as quality gates for Codex, Claude, Gemini, and you.
- [CodeRabbit Plan | Structured Plans for AI Coding](https://www.coderabbit.ai/plan): Turn vague ideas into structured plans and context-rich prompts
- [Vibe check your code](https://www.coderabbit.ai/ide): Free AI code reviews directly in the IDE. Ship faster while maintaining your flow state.
- [Quality gates for every PR](https://www.coderabbit.ai/enterprise): Your org standards. Enforced on every PR, across every team.
- [All plans include a 14-day free trial](https://www.coderabbit.ai/pricing): No credit card required

